    "createTime": "2026-01-01T17:03:00.000Z",
    "updateTime": "2026-01-01T17:03:00.000Z"
  },
  {
    "_id": "art-efemeride-2a-malvinas",
    "title": "4月2日 · 马尔维纳斯老兵纪念日",
    "content": "<h2 style=\"font-size:34rpx;font-weight:700;margin:36rpx 0 16rpx;line-height:1.45;\">纪念什么</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 24rpx;\">纪念 1982 年<strong>马尔维纳斯（Malvinas，即福克兰）战争</strong>中的<strong>老兵（veteranos）</strong>与<strong>阵亡者（caídos）</strong>。阿根廷主张对这些岛屿的<strong>主权（soberanía）</strong>，常见说法是 <strong>Las Malvinas son argentinas</strong>。这一天以缅怀和致敬为主。</p><h2 style=\"font-size:34rpx;font-weight:700;margin:36rpx 0 16rpx;line-height:1.45;\">关键词</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 24rpx;font-size:26rpx;display:table;table-layout:fixed;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;background:#F2F6F9;font-weight:600;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">西语</th><th style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;background:#F2F6F9;font-weight:600;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">含义</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">la guerra</td><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">战争</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">el/la veterano/a</td><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">老兵</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">los caídos</td><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">阵亡者</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">la soberanía</td><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">主权</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">las islas</td><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">岛屿</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">rendir homenaje</td><td style=\"border:1rpx solid #D9DEE3;padding:12rpx 10rpx;word-break:break-word;\">致敬、悼念</td></tr></table><h2 style=\"font-size:34rpx;font-weight:700;margin:36rpx 0 16rpx;line-height:1.45;\">学校的 acto</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 24rpx;\">向老兵和阵亡者<strong>致敬（rendir homenaje）</strong>，有时会请老兵来讲述经历。</p><h2 style=\"font-size:34rpx;font-weight:700;margin:36rpx 0 16rpx;line-height:1.45;\">怎么聊</h2><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 24rpx;padding:16rpx 24rpx;border-left:6rpx solid #3B6E8F;background:#F2F6F9;color:#42474D;border-radius:0 8rpx 8rpx 0;\">El 2 de abril recordamos a los veteranos y caídos en Malvinas.<br>Es un día para <strong>rendir homenaje</strong> a los soldados.</blockquote>",
    "summary": "缅怀 1982 年马岛战争的老兵与阵亡者",
    "categoryId": "cat-spanish-classroom",
    "tags": [
      "阿根廷"
    ],
